OL,3,C'Ideal for mosquitoes': Insect number
OL,4,Ccould rise in NI
OL,6,FThe number of mosquitoes in Northern
OL,7,FIreland could increase if the climate
OL,8,Fgets warmer and wetter in the future.
OL,10,FThat's according to researchers from
OL,11,FQueen's University Belfast who have
OL,12,Ffound a record amount over the summer.
OL,14,FThe team is currently gathering
OL,15,Finformation across Northern Ireland as
OL,16,Fpart of a project aiming to build a
OL,17,Fbetter understanding of the insect.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
