PN,41602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786882711
OL,3,C'Ideal for mosquitoes': Insect number
OL,4,Ccould rise in NI
OL,6,FBallykelly Forest is one of the areas
OL,7,Fthey visit to collect samples and
OL,8,Fbring them back to Queen's University
OL,9,Fin Belfast.
OL,11,FSome residents in the Londonderry
OL,12,Fvillage have said they have been
OL,13,Fbitten by the insect locally; a
OL,14,Fmosquito that bites is known as a
OL,15,Fnuisance mosquito.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
