PN,41603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786882711
OL,3,C'Ideal for mosquitoes': Insect number
OL,4,Ccould rise in NI
OL,6,FLecturer Dr Ross Cuthbert said: "We're
OL,7,Ftrying to find out what habitats
OL,8,Fthey're breeding in and what species
OL,9,Fare breeding in those habitats, and
OL,10,Fthen, whether those species are known
OL,11,Fto cause a nuisance.
OL,13,F"And then in doing that, we can be
OL,14,Fmore informed as to where nuisance
OL,15,Fbiting species are coming from.
OL,17,FHe added: "If it gets warmer and
OL,18,Fwetter, that's really ideal for
OL,19,Fmosquitoes, and we're kind of
OL,20,Fexpecting that in future.
OL,26,@nD@aOUuD@AOUyD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
