PN,41604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786882711
OL,3,C'Ideal for mosquitoes': Insect number
OL,4,Ccould rise in NI
OL,6,F"That means there'll be more breeding
OL,7,Fhabitats as well as longer activity
OL,8,Ftime, so I don't think the issue is
OL,9,Fgoing to be going away anytime soon."
OL,11,FAidan Desjardins, a PhD student at the
OL,12,Funiversity, was tasked with setting up
OL,13,Ftraps during the team's trip to the
OL,14,Fforest.
OL,16,FThe bait he put in the traps was a bar
OL,17,Fof lactic acid, which he described as
OL,18,F"essentially concentrated human sweat".
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@eO]zD@AOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
