PN,41605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1786882711
OL,3,C'Ideal for mosquitoes': Insect number
OL,4,Ccould rise in NI
OL,6,FThe researchers also looked for
OL,7,Fsamples in the muddy stagnant water
OL,8,Fpools found in the forest as
OL,9,Fmosquitoes like to breed in that type
OL,10,Fof environment.
OL,12,FThe insect can also breed in salt
OL,13,Fmarshes, such as the one beside Lough
OL,14,FFoyle.
OL,16,FThe team are eager for the public to
OL,17,Fget involved and are encouraging
OL,18,Fpeople to report any sightings of the
OL,19,Finsect via their website.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/6
